            },
            "description": "Input nilai langsung per CPMK (OBE Langsung).\nSistem otomatis:\n1. nilaiAkhir = Σ(nilaiCPMK × bobotCPMK) / 100\n2. Cek target CPMK → jika nilai CPMK < target → grade E otomatis\n3. Simpan ke siak_nilai_cpmk_mahasiswa\n\nCPMK033: target=40, CPMK034: target=5"
